// Domain Trust Discovery With Nltest
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_domain_trust_discovery_nltest.yml (7553634a-e987-4a59-81ad-0597b2300d43)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1482 Domain Trust Discovery
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and (process.executable:"*\\nltest.exe" and (process.command_line like~ ("*/domain_trusts*", "*/all_trusts*", "*/dclist:*")))
